{{> fragments/header}}

<a href="/exchange" class="main-hero">
    <span class="main-hero-overlay">
        <strong>GOODSBRIDGE</strong>
        <span>안전한 굿즈 교환의 시작</span>
        <span class="main-hero-cta">EXPLORE →</span>
    </span>
</a>

<section class="hero-grid">
    <a href="/exchange" class="hero-block">
        <div class="hero-mock">
            <div class="mock-card"><div class="mock-img"></div><div class="mock-line"></div><div class="mock-line short"></div></div>
            <div class="mock-card"><div class="mock-img"></div><div class="mock-line"></div><div class="mock-line short"></div></div>
            <div class="mock-card"><div class="mock-img"></div><div class="mock-line"></div><div class="mock-line short"></div></div>
        </div>
        <span class="hero-overlay">
            <span class="hero-label">EXCHANGE</span>
            <span class="hero-title">교환 게시판</span>
        </span>
    </a>
    <a href="/test/item" class="hero-block">
        <div class="hero-mock mock-grid-2">
            <div class="mock-card"><div class="mock-img"></div></div>
            <div class="mock-card"><div class="mock-img"></div></div>
            <div class="mock-card"><div class="mock-img"></div></div>
            <div class="mock-card"><div class="mock-img"></div></div>
        </div>
        <span class="hero-overlay">
            <span class="hero-label">SHOP</span>
            <span class="hero-title">상품 둘러보기</span>
        </span>
    </a>
</section>

<section class="category-rank">
    <div class="category-list">
        <h2>인기 교환 카테고리</h2>
        <ol>
            <li><span>01</span>포토카드</li>
            <li><span>02</span>앨범</li>
            <li><span>03</span>피규어</li>
            <li><span>04</span>응원봉</li>
            <li><span>05</span>포스터</li>
        </ol>
    </div>
    <a href="/exchange" class="category-photo">
        <span class="category-photo-overlay">
            <strong>포토카드</strong>
            <span>자세히 보기</span>
        </span>
    </a>
</section>

<section class="promo-strip">
    보증금으로 지키는 안전 교환 · 오프라인 매장 중개
</section>

<a href="/test/event" class="event-feature">
    <div class="event-feature-photo"></div>
    <div class="event-feature-content">
        <div class="event-feature-photo-sub"></div>
        <div class="event-feature-text">
            <span class="event-eyebrow">FIRST COME FIRST SERVED</span>
            <h2>선착순 이벤트</h2>
            <p>가게에서 여는 선착순 이벤트에 참여하고 번호표를 받아보세요</p>
            <span class="event-feature-link">이벤트 보러가기 →</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</a>

{{> fragments/footer}}
